<title>POLAND: All Polish minimum T-bill prices fall at tender.</title>
<headline>All Polish minimum T-bill prices fall at tender.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minimum prices of all Polish T-bills fell at today's primary auction on total demand of 628 million zlotys against a one billion zloty offer, the finance ministry said.  </p>
<p>   T-bill	    8-week  13-week  26-week 39-week   52-week</p>
<p>   new min price     --     95.30    91.02     --	83.25</p>
<p>   (pvs auction)     --    (95.44)  (91.10)    --     (83.32)</p>
<p>   new max price     --     95.47    91.14     --	83.48</p>
<p>   (pvs auction)     --    (95.51)  (91.14)    --     (83.65)</p>
<p>   offer		 --     200.0    300.0     --	500.0</p>
<p>   bids recorded     --     161.4     67.9     --	398.8</p>
<p>   bids accepted     --     152.4     32.9     --	134.0</p>
<p>   next auction	--     200.0    300.0     --	500.0</p>
<p>NOTE. Offer and all bids in million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
